 "standard_text": "Find the squares of whole numbers; identify perfect squares; find square roots of perfect squares by factors; solve problems on squares and square roots. (summary of the NERDC Primary 5 Mathematics curriculum)",
 "meta_desc": "Free Primary 5 maths worksheets on square numbers, perfect squares and square roots of whole numbers, with word problems on square gardens and tiles. 100 questions with answers.",
 "key_big": "5² = 5 × 5 = 25",
